### Case: unknown-key — a well-formed value that resolves to no app.
### Expect 401 with "Invalid API key in request".
### This is also the shape of a REVOKED terminal's request once its app is deleted
### or its credential rotated.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/fleet/price-list
X-Device-Key: 00000000-not-a-real-key
accept: application/json
